---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contribute" description="How to contribute to Queerview.">
  <h1>Contribute</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Queerview is currently in its seed phase — all entries are added and reviewed by maintainers
    only while the initial dataset (200+ titles) is established.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Coming in v1.1</h2>
    <p>
      Once the seed dataset is established, contribution will open via GitHub Pull Requests. Each
      PR will add or update one title at a time. A <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> guide will walk
      through the tagging vocabulary and sourcing requirements, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Every identity tag must include a source type.</li>
      <li>Trope and rep quality tags require a notes field with a brief argument.</li>
      <li>Contributors agree that queer identities themselves are not up for debate.</li>
      <li>Contested tags are welcomed when accompanied by a clear, respectful argument.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>In the meantime</h2>
    <p>
      If you've spotted an error in an existing entry or know of a title Queerview is missing,
      check back once contribution tooling opens, or reach out to the maintainers directly.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .lede {
    max-width: 42rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  section h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  code {
    color: var(--accent-gold);
  }
</style>
